<title>USA: Viking sees Q4 EPS flat at $0.19.</title>
<headline>Viking sees Q4 EPS flat at $0.19.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viking Office Products Inc said Tuesday it expects earnings per share for the fiscal fourth quarter ending June 30 to be flat with year-ago earnings of $0.19 per share.</p>
<p>&quot;We will report a flat fourth quarter,&quot; M. Bruce Nelson, Viking president and chief operating officer, told analysts at the PaineWebber Aggressive Growth &amp; Technology Conference in New York.</p>
<p>Nelson said fourth quarter revenues are growing a little faster than a previous forecast of 15 percent growth from a year earlier.</p>
